<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong securities body names senior officials.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong securities body names senior officials.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong Securities Clearing Co Ltd said in a statement on Wednesday that John Chan Cho Chak has been re-elected as chairman of the organisation.</p>
<p>Ian Ramsay Wilson was named first deputy chairman, while Chan Yuk Shee and Dannis Lee have been elected deputy chairmen, it said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
